      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1．多面角的每一个面角的度数小于其它的面角的度数",
        "的和。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2．在凸多面角中，各面角的度数的和小于 $360^\\circ$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这些性质在《附录》（第 302—304 页）中给出了证明。"
      ]
    },
    {
