    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "391",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "391．利用以下的面角能制成三面角的模型吗？1) $100^\\circ$、",
        "$120^\\circ$、$10^\\circ$；2) $80^\\circ$、$50^\\circ$、$30^\\circ$；3) $125^\\circ$、$120^\\circ$、$115^\\circ$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "392",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "392．1) 三面角的两个面角等于 $70^\\circ$ 和 $80^\\circ$。求第三个面",
        "角在怎样的范围内？",
        "2) 对于 $100^\\circ$ 和 $120^\\circ$ 解答同样的问题。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "393",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "393．三面角所有的面都是直角。求这个三面角的二面",
        "角的度数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "394",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "394．证明：如果三面角的面角的度数的和等于 $180^\\circ$，",
        "那么它们都是锐角。"
      ]
    },
